---
title: Gate Control State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Armed : vehicle_detected\n(LiDAR trigger)
    Armed --> Opening : verdict=AUTHORIZED
    Armed --> Idle : verdict=DENIED\nor timeout(30s)

    Opening --> OpenHold : gate_fully_open\n(limit switch)
    Opening --> Obstruction : obstacle_detected\n(safety sensor)

    OpenHold --> Closing : vehicle_cleared\n(LiDAR confirms)\n+ hold_delay expired
    OpenHold --> Obstruction : obstacle_detected

    Closing --> Idle : gate_fully_closed\n(limit switch)
    Closing --> Obstruction : obstacle_detected
    Closing --> OpenHold : vehicle_re_entered\n(LiDAR detects)

    Obstruction --> Opening : obstacle_cleared\n(retry open)
    Obstruction --> Fault : obstruction_timeout\n(>60s unresolved)

    Fault --> Idle : manual_reset\n(dashboard or\nphysical button)

    state ManualOverride {
        [*] --> ForceOpen
        [*] --> ForceClose
        [*] --> Disarm
    }

    Idle --> ManualOverride : guard_override\n(dashboard command)
    Armed --> ManualOverride : guard_override
    OpenHold --> ManualOverride : guard_override
    Closing --> ManualOverride : guard_override
    ManualOverride --> Idle : override_released

    note right of Idle
        Gate is closed and locked.
        LiDAR continuously scans
        for approaching vehicles.
    end note

    note right of Obstruction
        Safety-critical state.
        Gate motor stopped.
        Alarm raised on dashboard.
        Buzzer activated at gate.
    end note

    note right of Fault
        Requires human intervention.
        Gate motor disabled.
        All events logged.
    end note

    note left of Opening
        Motor direction: OPEN
        For sliding: motor forward
        For dual-leaf: both wings open
        Safety sensors active
    end note

    note left of Closing
        Motor direction: CLOSE
        Auto-reverse on obstacle
        LiDAR monitors gate zone
    end note
